Do NOT touch: conf/enrichment.conf, the sources under pipelines/enrichment/src/main, scripts/newspipe, .LLMDD/**, or any tracked file. Every step above reads them and writes none of them. The only file this CU may write is .env, and only temporarily, restored from the backup taken in step 1 before this CU ends.
